OL,3,GNEWSAMum to travel to US over
OL,4,Adaughter's shooting death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a British woman who was
OL,7,Funlawfully killed after being shot by
OL,8,Fher father in Texas is preparing to
OL,9,Ftravel to the US to try to persuade
OL,10,Fprosecutors to reopen the investigation
OL,11,Finto her death.
OL,13,FLucy Harrison, 23, from Warrington, was
OL,14,Fshot in the chest on 10 January 2025 in
OL,15,FProsper, near Dallas.
OL,17,FPolice in the town investigated her
OL,18,Fdeath as possible manslaughter but no
OL,19,Fcriminal case was brought against her
OL,20,Ffather Kris Harrison after a grand jury
OL,21,Fin Collin County declined to indict
OL,22,Fhim.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
