OL,3,GNEWSAMum to travel to US over
OL,4,Adaughter's shooting death
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucy Harrison's mother Jane Coates said
OL,7,Fshe hopes to meet the district attorney
OL,8,Fand call for a fresh investigation. The
OL,9,FCollin County District Attorney's
OL,10,FOffice has been approached for comment.
